    "reproduction_design": "A dependency-free harness reads pack manifests and the blobs they claim through a positive allowlist of read-only git plumbing subcommands at a caller-pinned commit id. It normalises the two manifest dialects present in the corpus, checks path membership, SHA-256, byte count, file_count, total_bytes, aggregate coverage and embedded build-host absolute paths, and indexes the whole scoped tree by content digest so a relocated file is distinguished from a lost one. It was first qualified against a sanitized adversarial fixture whose 11 injected discrepancies were declared before the run, then applied to three immutable commits.",
